## Install

```sh
corepack enable  # once per machine — puts the pinned pnpm on PATH
pnpm install
```

Commit `pnpm-lock.yaml` with the initial commit — CI installs with
`--frozen-lockfile` and fails without it.

## Use

{% if project_kind == 'app' %}
```sh
pnpm start       # run the app (tsx)
just test        # vitest
just typecheck   # tsc --noEmit (the only type check — vitest/tsx never check)
just fmt         # biome (the base's `format` verb owns markdown)
```
{% else %}
```sh
just build       # emit dist/ + declarations (tsc -p tsconfig.build.json)
just test        # vitest
just typecheck   # tsc --noEmit (the only type check — vitest/tsx never check)
just fmt         # biome (the base's `format` verb owns markdown)
```

Keep public exports explicitly typed — declaration emit (the build) fails on
non-portable inferred types (TS2742) that `typecheck` alone never sees.
`publishConfig` is deliberately unset: pick the registry when this actually
publishes somewhere.
{% endif %}

